Time Flux is a system that can speed up the pace of the game through resources gained while the game is not running.

There are two types of resources used here: TF (Time Flux) and OF (Offline Flux).
Both are expressed in units of time.

Both TF and OF accumulate while the game is not running, and on mobile, they accumulate even if the app is in the background.

When the player first enters the game, 30 minutes of TF are granted as a bonus.

TF is expressed as "days:hours:minutes:seconds", which might be a little difficult to understand.
