==TF and OF acquisition allocation==
TF and OF accumulate according to the amount of time the game is not running, but the ratio at which these two accumulate can be changed.

For example, of the initial setting, 6 minutes of TF and 10 minutes of OF are accumulated per hour in real life.
By moving the [Converted TF] bar, you can adjust how much of the 6 minutes of TF per hour is reduced and put into OF.
The conversion formula is "hourly TF x conversion % x 5/3",
and for example, if you select 70% conversion, 7 minutes will be added to the hourly OF (6 minutes x 70% x 5/3), resulting in 17 minutes of OF per hour, which means that the hourly TF should be reduced by 70%, to about 1 minute 48 seconds.
(For reference, 5/3 ≒ 1.67 times)

However, please note that you should use the value before calculating the hidden  achievements and shop boost bonuses (basic TF acquisition amount).
These boosts are applied to the converted hourly TF.

===How to only gain TF===
The hourly OF accumulation of 10 minutes cannot be reduced any further. For example, it is impossible to accumulate only 5 minutes of OF per hour in real life.

However, as an exception, it is possible to not accumulate OF at all.
The method is to uncheck offline flux, which will set OF per hour to 0ms, and instead increase TF acquisition by 6 minutes per hour.

===How to only gain OF===
Check offline flux and move the slider all the way to 100%.
In the initial state, 5/3 times the time of TF6, or 10 minutes, should be added to OF, making it 20 minutes.

==TF and OF usage plan==
Use TF for acceleration and upgrades, and time warp with OF.
Time warp is used selectively, so it is better to uncheck the automatic use when OF is started and use it in small increments only as needed.

===Use for Upgrades:===
It is recommended to obtain 2 times the very cost-effective TF acquisition increase (including the 1 time of doubling the TF capacity required for strengthening, it will pay for itself in about 22 hours). After that, it depends on your play style.

===Use for 3x acceleration:===
If you need to operate something, it is best to use this. It is especially effective in the early stages when automation is not possible.

==Ads==
In the mobile version of the app, you can get TF6 minutes by pressing the [Watch Ad] button and watching a 15-second to 1-minute ad.
After you get TF6 minutes, you can wait 5 minutes in real time to watch an ad again. You can watch up to 30 videos in 12 hours.
If you purchase the Remove Ads product, you can receive rewards directly without watching ads.

Even if you purchase a product that removes ads in another medium, it will not be available in the Steam version.

==TIPS: Idle vs. TF Saving ==
Is it better to leave the game on or to close the game and save up TF?
The basic structure of this game is to shorten the time it takes to reach your goal by buying upgrades.

Leaving the game alone without being able to buy upgrades is not a good idea, and it tends to be more efficient to save up TF and use a high gamespeed

On the other hand, leaving the game alone is more efficient in areas where you don't need to need to upgrade things manually.
Specifically, when you have unlocked automations and macros, so there is no need to press the buttons.
In the dilation tree, there is nothing to do but leave the game alone to earn Σ.
When you only leave the game alone for a short time, there is not much time to wait before buying upgrades.

Increased TF gain is cheap in the early stages and grows well, so it will be more comfortable to purchase a few.

==Online TF Gain==
When your accumulated Time Flux and Offline Flux gain exceed 1 hour per hour, you will generate extra Time Flux, even while playing the game. This allows you to take advantage of your excess Time Flux gain while staying online.

You need to turn on the Offline Flux and change the Converted TF to 100%. Check the Time Flux per hour on the left side, it will show how many Online TF you will get in 1 hour.

After level 8 of the Increasing TF Gain upgrades, you will start to have an online TF gain.

When you need to stay online in the game for a long time, it's best to turn it on — even if it gives you very little TF, it's better than nothing.

==Summary==
"TF" and "OF" conversion are as follows.

The basic OF gain amount is equivalent to 10 minutes per hour.

The basic TF gain amount (before bonuses are applied) can be converted to OF gain amount with 5/3 times the efficiency, and this conversion is limited to a total OF gain amount of 60:00 OF/h.

Therefore, the TF gain amount used for OF conversion is limited to 30:00 TF/h.

(30 minutes x 100% x 5/3 = 50 minutes) Add 10 minutes of basic OF gain to that and you get 60:00 OF/h)

When the total OF gain amount reaches 60:00 OF/h, TF can be gain online according to the remaining TF gain amount.

In other words, since the basic TF gain amount does not exceed 30:00 TF/h unless you upgrade it to the 8th stage, you cannot acquire TF online at the 7th stage or below.

Example:

Let's consider a case where the amount of TF acquired becomes "31:34 TF/h" due to the 8th lvl upgrade.
The first 30 minutes of this is used to convert to OF. This brings the total amount of OF gain to the upper limit of 60 minutes.
Then, the remaining "1:34 TF/h" (31 minutes 34 seconds - 30 minutes) is the amount of TF that can be gain directly online, and you will be able to obtain 1 minute 34 seconds of TF per hour.
The bonus to TF is added to the remaining 1:34 TF/h.

