== Statistics for nerds ==
TF gain formula:
 TFGain = TFGBase × (shop TF mult + secret Ach TF mult)
if Offline flux production is OFF:
 TFGBase = 3600 × (TFG Upgrade level + 1)/(TFG Upgrade level + 10)
if Offline flux production is ON:
 TFGBase = 3600 × (TFG Upgrade level + 1)/(TFG Upgrade level + 10) + (OF conversion × min(1800, 3600 × (TFG Upgrade level + 1)/(TFG Upgrade level + 10)))
OF gain formula: <br>
if Offline flux production is OFF:
 OFGain = 0
if Offline flux production is ON:
 OFGain = 5/3 × OF conversion × min(1800, 3600 × (TFG Upgrade level + 1)/(TFG Upgrade level + 10)) + 600
All numbers are in seconds

OF conversion is a fraction, not a percentage (e.g. 37% = 0.37)

